  m_Text: 'WASD / Arrows  Move     Shift  Sprint     Space  Jump     Mouse  Look

    Right click  Grab one pepper / object; click again to release

    Hold left mouse with crate  Gather highlighted set into crate

    Hold / release left mouse with one object  Charge / throw

    E  Set down / put pepper in crate / tip at intake / collect / hand off

    F  Pour the crate toward your aim (misses stay recoverable)

    G  Release     Z / X  Optional rotation     Esc  Pause


    F1  This reference     R  Recover objects and stray peppers (keeps food)

    F8  Restart food test (clears stored food too)

    F9  Compare pepper simulation (test tool; keeps food)'
